Z||000006||Spyder||02-16-2000||10:21 PM||||The wheels are ROH ZS wheels.<BR>I thought I had a pic of the side by side but couldn’t find it.<BR>I will compare them tomorrow.<BR>The 17x7.5 is $200 each and I bought them from JD Wheels, best price and got them in two days: <A HREF="http://www.jdwheels.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.jdwheels.com/</A>  <BR>I talked to JD and he was very nice and helpful.<BR>Tires 215/40/WR17 were $215 each at the tire rack.<BR>Bad news, they’re going on my kit car. So I’m using spacers and adapters.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Spyder||02-17-2000||10:18 PM||||The 17x7.5 wheel and tire was only a half inch wider and about half inch shorter than the stock wheel with 195/70/14 tires.||||reg||1
